      "description": "Prepare a withdrawal of collateral tokens from a Morpho Blue market position. Returns a ready-to-sign transactions array. Supports \"max\" for full collateral withdrawal. Includes health factor check when user has active borrows. No approval needed for withdrawals.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
